//github.com/cordum-io/cordum)\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49880505\nPoints: 1\n# Comments: 0","full_content":"","image":"","pub_date":"2026-09-28T16:25:32+00:00","source":"Hacker News AI","source_key":"hn_ai_7","cat":"ai","media_url":"","media_type":"","title_zh":"Show HN：Cordum Edge – 沙箱 AI 编码代理的本地防火墙","time_str":"44分钟前","tags":["cordum","edge","沙箱"]},{"title":"The problem is not the AI code, but nobody knows anything anymore","link":"https://www.ssp.sh/brain/the-problem-is-not-the-ai-code-but-nobody-knows-anything-anymore/","summary":"Article URL: https://www.ssp.sh/brain/the-problem-is-not-the-ai-code-but-nobody-knows-anything-anymore/\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49880312\nPoints: 181\n# Comments: 105","full_content":"","image":"","pub_date":"2026-09-28T16:11:42+00:00","source":"Hacker News AI","source_key":"hn_ai_7","cat":"ai","media_url":"","media_type":"","title_zh":"问题不在于AI代码，而在于现在谁也不再了解了。","time_str":"58分钟前","tags":["问题不在于","代码","而在于"]},{"title":"AI-guided optimization for thermostable mRNA vaccines","link":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41587-026-03330-x","summary":"Article URL: https://www.nature.com/articles/s41587-026-03330-x\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49880239\nPoints: 1\n# Comments: 0","full_content":"","image":"","pub_date":"2026-09-28T16:07:08+00:00","source":"Hacker News AI","source_key":"hn_ai_7","cat":"ai","media_url":"","media_type":"","title_zh":"基于人工智能的优化，用于热稳定性mRNA疫苗","time_str":"1小时前","tags":["人工智能","疫苗","mrna"]},{"title":"Create AI Workout Plans with Cloudflare Durable Objects","link":"https://blog.master.dev/making-the-most-of-vercels-ai-sdk-with-cloudflare-durable-objects/","summary":"Article URL: https://blog.master.dev/making-the-most-of-vercels-ai-sdk-with-cloudflare-durable-objects/\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49880083\nPoints: 2\n# Comments: 0","full_content":"","image":"","pub_date":"2026-09-28T15:57:18+00:00","source":"Hacker News AI","source_key":"hn_ai_7","cat":"ai","media_url":"","media_type":"","title_zh":"使用 Cloudflare 持久对象创建 AI 健身计划","time_str":"1小时前","tags":["cloudflare","持久对象创建","健身计划"]}]},{"key":"hn_llm_8","name":"Hacker News LLM","cat":"ai","color":"#ef6c00","tier":2,"items":[{"title":"Show HN: Assay – a QA CLI that finds bugs with no LLM and no tests written","link":"https://github.com/awss1i/assay","summary":"I've always found it odd there was no deterministic QA tools with zero baseline needed, especially after so long. It's always been either (1) playwright or cypress that require written tests, dependant on the tests YOU write, or (2), asking the LLM to find and test bugs in your code, which has 2 cons, its costly (sometimes), and its non-deterministic.That's why i built assay. Its only dependencies is playwright & chromium, and you point it at any folder with a webpage and it runs tests on its ow…","full_content":"","image":"","pub_date":"2026-09-28T16:09:31+00:00","source":"Hacker News LLM","source_key":"hn_llm_8","cat":"ai","media_url":"","media_type":"","title_zh":"Show HN: Assay – 一个 QA CLI，可以在没有 LLM 且没有编写测试的情况下发现错误","time_str":"1小时前","tags":["assay","qa","cli"]}]},{"key":"aihot_full_21","name":"AI Hot 精选全文","cat":"ai","color":"#ea580c","tier":2,"items":[{"title":"Claude Opus 5.5 (High) 进入 Agent Arena 第 2 名，成本比 Opus 5 (Max) 低 56%","link":"https://aihot.news/items/zdcla5xi4k1w5veg5n4jff1w4","summary":"Arena 公布 Claude Opus 5.5 (High) 进入 Agent Arena 排名第 2，净改进分 +12.15%，仅次于 Fable 5.1 (Max)。\n🔗 阅读原文\nvia AIHOT · https://aihot.news/items/zdcla5xi4k1w5veg5n4jff1w4","full_content":"\u003cp>来自 @AnthropicAI 的 Claude Opus 5.5 (High) 刚刚进入 Agent Arena，排名第 #2，净提升分数为 +12.15%。只有 Fable 5.1 (Max) 排名更高。然而，Opus 5.5 (High) 每任务中位价格为 $1.31，成本降低了 64%，从而推进了帕累托前沿。\u003c/p>\u003cp>Opus 5.5 (High) 的净提升分数高于之前两个 Opus 5 变体，同时成本比 Opus 5 (High) 低 40%，比 Opus 5 (Max) 低 56%。\u003c/p>\u003cp>按信号划分，Opus 5.5 (High) 排名：\u003cbr>- #1 可操控性 (+14.50%)\u003cbr>- #2 确认成功 (+15.50%)\u003cbr>- #3 表扬与投诉对比 (+19.80%)\u003cbr>- #4 Bash 恢复 (+10.64%)\u003c/p>\u003cp>祝贺 @AnthropicAI 又发布了一款前沿模型！\u003c/p>\u003cblockquote>\u003cp>引用 @arena：\u003c/p>\u003cp>Big news: Claude Opus 5.5 (Max) by @AnthropicAI just topped #1 in Code Arena: WebDev with 1818 pts and reshapes the Pareto frontier! This is a solid +26pt lead ahead of the next best model, GPT-6 Astra (Max) and a huge +126pt improvement over previous Opus 5 (Max) at 1692.\u003c/p>\u003cp>Across categories, we can see that Opus 5.5 (Max) lands in the top spots across domains for:\u003cbr>- #1 Brand and Marketing, Reference-Based Design, Data & Analytics, Simulations and Gaming!\u003cbr>- #2 Consumer Product\u003c/p>\u003cp>Stay tuned for more domain and categorical insights to land as more votes come in.\u003c/p>\u003cp>Congrats to @AnthropicAI on the release!\u003c/p>\u003cp>\u003ca href=\"https://x.com/arena/status/2102952767614779403\">https://x.com/arena/status/2102952767614779403\u003c/a>\u003c/p>\u003c/blockquote>\u003cp>—— 本文由 AIHOT 聚合整理，完整版与更多 AI 动态见 \u003ca href=\"https://aihot.news/items/zdcla5xi4k1w5veg5n4jff1w4\">https://aihot.news/items/zdcla5xi4k1w5veg5n4jff1w4\u003c/a>\u003c/p>","image":"","pub_date":"2026-09-28T17:00:36+00:00","source":"AI Hot 精选全文","source_key":"aihot_full_21","cat":"ai","media_url":"","media_type":"","title_zh":"Claude Opus 5.5 (High) 进入 Agent Arena 第 2 名，成本比 Opus 5 (Max) 低 56%","time_str":"9分钟前","tags":["agent","claude","opus"]}]},{"key":"aihot_pool_22","name":"AI Hot 7天公开池","cat":"ai","color":"#dc2626","tier":2,"items":[{"title":"Base44 发布 Base Code 早期预览：云端开发环境与团队协作","link":"https://aihot.news/items/n3vxuq5ght6ccvi57z7k0jfyw","summary":"Base44 推出 Base Code 早期预览，连接 GitHub 仓库后由智能体在云端配置数据库、基础设施和示例数据，直至运行出实时预览。它支持通过聊天修改代码库并提交 pull request，团队任意成员可在浏览器中协作，未来将支持 WhatsApp / iMessage；产品免费开放 30 天，并计划推出自动化与软件工厂能力。\n🔗 阅读原文\nvia AIHOT · https://aihot.news/items/n3vxuq5ght6ccvi57z7k0jfyw","full_content":"","image":"","pub_date":"2026-09-28T16:40:35+00:00","source":"AI Hot 7天公开池","source_key":"aihot_pool_22","cat":"ai","